MengLuo DSH Android
Copyright (c) 2026 Coyami-Mengluo

An unofficial client for DeepSeek Harness; not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek.
The application icon was generated by the project owner using ChatGPT and adapted for this project.

Our shell source is licensed under MIT. Bundled third-party libraries keep
their respective licenses. See app/src/main/assets/notices/THIRD-PARTY.txt.

The source code corresponding to the bundled native PRoot, libtalloc and
libandroid-shmem components, together with their Termux build recipes and
patches, is provided alongside each public APK as native-corresponding-source.tar.gz:
https://github.com/Coyami-Mengluo/mengluo-dsh-android/releases

Ubuntu Base, Node.js and DeepSeek Harness are not included in the public APK.
They are downloaded on demand from the selected upstream/mirror sources.
Their original licenses and notices are retained in the installed environment.
